        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅನುಮಾನಪಡು (anumānapaḍu) is anumāna, \"doubt, suspicion\", from Sanskrit anumāna, \"inference, thought\" (CDIAL 328), and native paḍu, \"to undergo, feel\" (DEDR 3853): \"to feel a doubt\"."
